[{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"## SAS Data Reporting","outputs":[]},{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"🐝  To compare flowering periods of native vs non native plants, Let's first get the data ready. clean up the garden log by tossing empty flower labels, tag plants by year, and jot down what month blooms happen to help the bees!","outputs":[]},{"kind":2,"language":"sas","value":"data dst4_modified;\n  set dst4;\n  where 'plant species'n ne ' ';\n  PlantSpecies_Year=catx('-','plant species'n,year);\n  Month=month(date);\nrun;","outputs":[{"items":[{"data":"[\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"952  /** LOG_START_INDICATOR **/\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"953  title;footnote;ods _all_ close;\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"954  ods graphics on;\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"955  ods html5(id=vscode) style=HTMLEncore options(bitmap_mode='inline' svg_mode='inline');\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"NOTE: Writing HTML5(VSCODE) Body file: sashtml39.htm\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"note\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"956  %let _SASPROGRAMFILE = %nrquote(%nrstr(/workspaces/myfolder/Pharmasug25/5SASReport.sasnb));\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"957  data dst4_modified;\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"958    set dst4;\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"959    where 'plant species'n ne ' ';\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"960    PlantSpecies_Year=catx('-','plant species'n,year);\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"961    Month=month(date);\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t\t\"version\": 1\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t\"line\": \"962  run;\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"source\",\n\t